  "name": "WinDOM code",
  "notes": "The Windows-style environment is win11React in Playwright, not native Windows control. The repository documents its predecessor trajectory pipeline but explicitly omits the final corpus harvester. The inspected ScreenSpot evaluator defaults to a privileged ground-truth-center demonstration; --no-demo and --official-prompt select other modes, so evaluation results require their prompt and coordinate settings. Linked datasets, weights and reported scores were not independently verified; MIT applies to inspected repository code.",
